{
  "movie_id": 505000101,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 11.6,
      "end_time": 13.2,
      "text": "What do you think, Kishi-san?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 13.4,
      "end_time": 16.0,
      "text": "My outfit's concept is a vampire."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 16.8,
      "end_time": 20.8,
      "text": "I tried to decorate it with motifs like Miss Rei in various places."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 21.0,
      "end_time": 22.0,
      "text": "This place is..."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 22.2,
      "end_time": 22.8,
      "text": "Ahh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 23.0,
      "end_time": 25.8,
      "text": "Wait, wait! Please don't look at strange places!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 26.0,
      "end_time": 27.8,
      "text": "Please take a look at the costume properly!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 28.2,
      "end_time": 29.6,
      "text": "Roar!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 34.6,
      "end_time": 38.0,
      "text": "What do you think, pal? Do I look like a tiger monster to you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 38.8,
      "end_time": 40.6,
      "text": "It suits you well!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 41.0,
      "end_time": 44.2,
      "text": "As expected, it's best to make the most of your individuality, right?"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 44.4,
      "end_time": 45.8,
      "text": "What are you saying, pal?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 46.0,
      "end_time": 47.6,
      "text": "I'm a human, pal!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 48.0,
      "end_time": 48.8,
      "text": "Hmm?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 49.0,
      "end_time": 52.8,
      "text": "I was talking about Matsuri's lively personality"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 53.2,
      "end_time": 55.0,
      "text": "Y-You're right, pal!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 55.2,
      "end_time": 58.0,
      "text": "I'm an active human being, pal!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 59.0,
      "end_time": 62.8,
      "text": "Um... did she really intend to hide her ears with that?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 63.0,
      "end_time": 64.0,
      "text": "Yeah..."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 64.8,
      "end_time": 67.2,
      "text": "Anyway, Rei's late."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 67.8,
      "end_time": 70.0,
      "text": "She should have already finished changing her clothes, but..."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 70.6,
      "end_time": 72.2,
      "text": "I'm gonna go take a look!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 73.0,
      "end_time": 75.0,
      "text": "Ah, hey, wait, what are you touching?"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 75.2,
      "end_time": 78.0,
      "text": "I didn't touch anything weird, pal!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 78.2,
      "end_time": 80.2,
      "text": "Look, I want you to show it quickly!"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 80.4,
      "end_time": 83.4,
      "text": "I got it. I'm leaving now, so please don't rush me."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 83.8,
      "end_time": 85.0,
      "text": "Haah~"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 90.0,
      "end_time": 92.8,
      "text": "I think the quality of the costume is wonderful, but..."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 93.2,
      "end_time": 96.0,
      "text": "Tsumugi, why am I wearing such a costume..."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 96.8,
      "end_time": 99.8,
      "text": "Isn't it a little too awkward to be a ghost?"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 100.0,
      "end_time": 101.8,
      "text": "Wow! Miss Rei!"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 102.0,
      "end_time": 103.8,
      "text": "It's incredibly beautiful!"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 104.0,
      "end_time": 107.4,
      "text": "This is exactly the fragile female ghost that I imagined!"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 107.8,
      "end_time": 109.8,
      "text": "Do you think so too, Kishi-san?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start_time": 110.0,
      "end_time": 113.2,
      "text": "Ah, as expected, your feedback is good."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start_time": 113.6,
      "end_time": 116.2,
      "text": "Wait for me. I also want to hear his thoughts."
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start_time": 117.0,
      "end_time": 118.6,
      "text": "Wh-What do you think?"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start_time": 119.0,
      "end_time": 120.0,
      "text": "Don't you find it strange?"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start_time": 121.2,
      "end_time": 122.4,
      "text": "It suits you."
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start_time": 123.0,
      "end_time": 125.0,
      "text": "Is that so... Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start_time": 125.2,
      "end_time": 127.0,
      "text": "I feel a little better now"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start_time": 128.0,
      "end_time": 130.0,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start_time": 130.8,
      "end_time": 132.8,
      "text": "What are you staring at so intently?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start_time": 133.0,
      "end_time": 136.8,
      "text": "Kishi-san, please get to work behind the scenes"
    }
  ],
